        "id": "PL-09",
        "topic": "Epilogue map and campaign epoch",
        "disposition": "RESOLVED-SOURCE-RETAINED; DISCLOSURE-EPOCH-OPEN",
        "decision": "Retain P270-P276 Spiral Map and home-plane rule as original source material, but do not automatically publish or apply them in the current campaign. Use requires an established campaign epoch and revelation/disclosure decision.",
        "retainedFacts": [
