        "id": "PL-10",
        "topic": "Void labels and souls",
        "disposition": "RESOLVED-DISTINCTIONS; SOUL-JURISDICTION-DEFERRED",
        "decision": "Boundless Void (place), Void Sovereign (entity/title claim), Astral soul-transit claim, Shadow soul-collection claim, Ulnak/Old God, Binding and Interstice are not merged. Soul/death jurisdiction is handed to the next conference.",
        "retainedFacts": [
