            "part": "word/document.xml",
            "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 10169,
            "excerpt": "The Verdant Reflection is a vibrant, amplified reflection of the Material Plane, where nature, emotion, and magic are intensified to supernatural levels. It overlaps with the Material Plane in places of natural beauty and power, ancient forests, pristine lakes, majestic mountains, and stone circles.",
