            "part": "word/document.xml",
            "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 10383,
            "excerpt": "Based in the legendary city of Sigil (rumored to be at the center of the multiverse), the Sigil Compact is a coalition of planar travelers, merchants, and diplomats who seek to maintain open communication and trade between planes. They operate planar embassies, negotiate treaties, and mediate disputes between extraplanar entities.",
