        "label": "Infernal Conspiracy",
        "kind": "campaign tension",
        "group": "Current Planar Tensions",
        "authority": "mortal cosmographic/religious account in current Appendix B; not objective cosmic proof",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Player_Rulebook_v6.docx",
            "part": "word/document.xml",
            "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 10413,
            "excerpt": "The Infernal Conspiracy",
            "excerptSha256": "341c9377580ad7186c0c669df841a0dd4580686377c204db7d0f443115fa0995",
            "evidenceKind": "exact-source-paragraph"
          },
          {
            "path": "books/player/Decennium_Descent_Player_Rulebook_v6.docx",
            "part": "word/document.xml",
            "paragraphIndexZeroBased": 10415,
            "excerpt": "Agents of the Nine Infernal Courts have infiltrated multiple Material Plane governments, subtly influencing policy and sowing discord. Their ultimate goal appears to be the establishment of legal frameworks that technically permit diabolical intervention without violating the Divine Pact, potentially opening the door to large-scale infernal influence.",
